1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
If your steering wheel only shakes

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
at highway speed, that's not random.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Smooth around town, then a vibration

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
kicks in around 55 to 65.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One clue: it's the wheel and tire,

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
not the brakes — out-of-balance or a bent rim.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Only shakes when you brake?

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Different problem — a warped rotor.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess. A quick balance check

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
on the machine can find it fast.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it wears on your suspension.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
